B.acU=s(["At initiation: monitor temperature after starting KMC; assess breathing and colour, positioning and airway, and feeding.","During continuation: monitor temperature regularly; assess feeding and weight; track and document KMC duration.","KMC in sick babies: monitor heart rate, SpO\u2082 and respiratory rate/breathing and colour."],t.s)
