B.aeM=s(["Skin-to-skin, upright, between the mother\u2019s breasts.","Head turned to one side, neck slightly extended.","Hips flexed and abducted; arms flexed.","Secure with binder/wrap/garment; keep face visible and airway unobstructed.","Baby\u2019s clothing: wear cap to prevent heat loss; socks to keep feet warm; diaper or nappy.","Each session at least 1 hour. Aim for 24 hours while providing at least 8 hours. Record cumulative duration per 24 hours.","Mother can sleep, stand and walk in KMC position."],t.s)
B.YX=new A.aX(B.a2,B.a3,"Kangaroo position",B.aeM,B.o)
B.Ad=s(["Avoid > 12.5-15% dextrose infusion through a peripheral vein","Maintain patency of IV cannula","Use a syringe/infusion pump to deliver glucose","Avoid frequent dextrose boluses","Always search for an underlying cause \u2013 polycythemia, sepsis, meningitis, hypothermia, IUGR"],t.s)
B.YY=new A.aX(B.c7,B.Q,"PRACTICAL POINTS",B.Ad,B.o)
B.adK=s(["Oxygen therapy.","CPAP.","IV fluids or medications.","OG/NG tube feeding.","Phototherapy (interrupt only during treatment, resume immediately).","Twins: individually or together, depending on stability and caregiver availability."],t.s)
B.YZ=new A.aX(B.a2,B.a3,"Continue KMC while on",B.adK,B.o)
B.afH=s(["Discharge when the neonate meets discharge criteria as per unit policy.","Counsel for continuation of KMC while going home.","Continue KMC at home.","Refer to discharge and follow-up STW module."],t.s)
B.Z_=new A.aX(B.cD,B.Q,"Kangaroo discharge",B.afH,B.o)
B.aeY=s(["Do not initiate KMC in babies unable to breathe spontaneously after resuscitation, in shock, or requiring mechanical ventilation.","Do not routinely stop KMC for oxygen, CPAP, IV therapy, or tube feeding.","Do not delay KMC because the mother is unavailable; involve a trained alternate caregiver."],t.s)
B.Z0=new A.aX(B.c7,B.a3,"DON'Ts",B.aeY,B.o)
B.a8U=s(["For seizures: Inj. phenobarbitone 20 mg/kg IV over 15 min. If seizures persist after 15 min, give a further 10 mg/kg IV over 10 min.","If uncontrolled, consider levetiracetam as second-line treatment.","Correct glucose and calcium if abnormal, concurrently."],t.s)
