B.a9Q=s(["Continue KMC at discharge to home.","Continue KMC during intra- and inter-facility transport where feasible.","Confirm clinical stability before transporting in KMC position.","Secure safely with binder/wrap/KMC bag.","Accompany with trained provider when indicated.","Minimize interruption before, during and after transport."],t.s)
