B.aes=s(["Mother (preferred) \u2014 the primary KMC provider.","Father (alternate) \u2014 preferred alternate; identify and prepare before birth.","Another trained adult family member (backup) when the mother is temporarily unavailable.","Return to maternal KMC as soon as the mother is able."],t.s)
