B.aaK=s(["Any of the maternal risk factors: If age of baby is less than 3 days (72 hrs) and mother has >3 PV examinations during labour; Rupture of membranes >24 hrs; pPROM; Urinary tract infection; Diarrhea; Fever >38\xb0C"],t.s)
B.a4V=s(["START TREATMENT AND INVESTIGATE","Any RED flag is present","Any two YELLOW flags (signs or maternal risk factors) are present","One YELLOW flag (sign or maternal risk factor) is present AND baby\u2019s gestation at birth is \u226432 weeks or birth weight <1500 g","Admit in the NICU / SNCU","Obtain blood sample for culture and sensitivity (even if baby has received an antibiotic before admission)","Start empirical antibiotics as per local/unit policy, pending reports","Provide supportive care: thermal care, fluids & feeds, glucose monitoring, respiratory & circulatory support","Do labs as indicated (X-ray, CBC, platelets, RBS, electrolytes, renal function)","Perform lumbar puncture (LP) for CSF analysis when baby is hemodynamically stable"],t.s)
B.aaP=s(["Neonatal seizure always warrants urgent evaluation for cause (sepsis / meningitis, hypoglycaemia). Keep a low threshold to start antibiotics and perform LP."],t.s)
B.a6i=s(["Stop antibiotics","Keep under observation till blood culture is reported as sterile after 48 hrs of incubation"],t.s)
B.a7m=s(["Continue antibiotics",u.ev],t.s)
B.a84=s(["Upgrade antibiotics as per antibiotic local/unit policy",u.ev],t.s)
B.a7h=s(["If antibiotics were continued, review at 5 days. If the baby is now well, the 48-h blood culture is sterile and CSF is normal, stop antibiotics."],t.s)
B.a4J=s(["A sterile blood culture at 24\u201348 h after starting antibiotics supports early stopping of antibiotics."],t.s)
B.aaV=s(["Start antibiotics within 1 hour if high probability of sepsis is present","Draw blood culture before the first antibiotic dose","Review antibiotics at 48 h against culture, CRP and clinical course","Stop antibiotics if blood culture is sterile and the baby has recovered","Use serial observation and look for non-infective causes of illness"],t.s)
B.a8D=s(["Start antibiotics without an indication \u2013 clinical signs in neonates are non-specific","Continue antibiotics for a sterile culture in a baby who has recovered","Act on a positive CRP / procalcitonin in isolation \u2013 they are false positive in many non-infective conditions; use to rule out sepsis","Delay LP when it is indicated once the baby is stable"],t.s)
B.adz=s(["Blood culture before first antibiotic dose (%): Sepsis episodes with blood culture drawn before the first antibiotic dose / Sepsis episodes in which antibiotics were started \xd7100","Antibiotic initiation within 1 hour (%): Neonates with high probability of sepsis who received the first antibiotic dose within 1 hour of identification / All neonates identified as having high probability of sepsis \xd7100","Antibiotic exposure during admission (%): Neonates admitted during the reporting period who received at least one dose of a systemic antibiotic during their stay / All neonates admitted during the same reporting period \xd7100"],t.s)
B.a4E=s(["PREVENT SEPSIS BY ENSURING HAND HYGIENE, ASEPSIS DURING PROCEDURES AND DILIGENT HOUSEKEEPING"],t.s)
