B.ab_=s(["Keep increasing GIR beyond 12 mg/kg/min","Consider ENDOCRINE/METABOLIC disorders & REFER to higher centre; drugs for refractory hypoglycemia include hydrocortisone 5 mg/kg/day IV in two divided doses","Start antibiotics for hypoglycemia","Stop IV fluids and feed dextrose solution"],t.s)
B.ZN=new A.bQ("hypo_case_6","What does the STW advise?",B.ab_,1,'Flowchart: "Persistent (GIR requirement >3-7 days) or Refractory (GIR > 10-12 mg/kg/min for 24 hours) hypoglycemia" \u2192 "Consider ENDOCRINE/ METABOLIC disorders & REFER to higher centre". DRUGS FOR REFRACTORY HYPOGLYCEMIA: "Hydrocortisone: 5 mg/kg/day IV in two divided doses". DON\'Ts: "Do NOT give antibiotics for hypoglycemia unless sepsis is suspected".',"Refractory hypoglycemia","A neonate has needed a GIR > 10-12 mg/kg/min for 24 hours and BG remains < 45 mg/dL.",'ICMR/DHR STW "Neonatal Hypoglycemia" (August 2026), flowchart (persistent/refractory); DRUGS FOR REFRACTORY HYPOGLYCEMIA')
