B.a7L=s(["Resuscitation \u2022 Delayed cry","Acute perinatal event","Abnormal neurological signs"],t.s)
B.abi=s(["Breathing \u2022 Perfusion","Temperature \u2022 Glucose"],t.s)
B.a4L=s(["Encephalopathy (Modified Sarnat staging)"],t.s)
B.a9X=s(["Apgar \u22645 at 10 min \u2022 Still requiring PPV at 10 min \u2022 Cord or within 1 h: pH \u22647.1 or base deficit \u226512 mmol/L"],t.s)
B.abp=s(["Consciousness: MILD: Hyperalert; MODERATE: Lethargic; SEVERE: Stupor / coma","Spontaneous activity: MILD: Normal / increased; MODERATE: Decreased; SEVERE: Absent","Posture: MILD: Normal; MODERATE: Distal flexion; SEVERE: Decerebrate","Tone: MILD: Normal / increased; MODERATE: Hypotonia; SEVERE: Flaccid","Primitive reflexes: MILD: Suck: normal / incomplete; Moro: exaggerated; MODERATE: Suck: weak; Moro: incomplete; SEVERE: Suck / Moro: absent","Autonomic signs: MILD: Pupils: normal; HR: normal / fast; Breathing: regular; MODERATE: Pupils: constricted; HR: slow; Breathing: periodic / irregular; SEVERE: Pupils: dilated / deviated; HR: variable; breathing: apnoea"],t.s)
B.ade=s(["Record seizures separately; Repeat serial assessments; Initial normal examination does not exclude evolving HIE"],t.s)
B.abB=s(["Breastfeed; Skin-to-skin if stable","Observe \u226524 h; longer if concerns"],t.s)
B.adW=s(["Supportive care in SNCU/NICU","Serial neurological assessments",u.b8],t.s)
B.a7I=s(["Stabilize: Contact referral NICU","Arrange urgent transfer for advanced care"],t.s)
B.ab4=s(["HR / breathing / SpO\u2082: Continuous; record hourly. SpO\u2082 target 91\u201395% on supplemental oxygen. Ventilation if apnoea / inadequate breathing"],t.s)
B.ae0=s(["Perfusion / BP: At least hourly initially; more if unstable. Treat shock; avoid indiscriminate fluid boluses"],t.s)
B.a99=s(["Neurological status: Hourly till 6 h; then 4-hourly for 24\u201348 h; immediately if worsening. Detect and treat seizures; EEG/aEEG where available"],t.s)
B.acP=s(["Temperature: Hourly until 6 h; 2-hourly once stable. Aim 36.5\u201337.0\xb0C (unless under therapeutic hypothermia [TH]); Avoid hyperthermia (>37.5\xb0C)"],t.s)
B.a9D=s(["Blood glucose: At 1, 2 and 6 h; then 6-hourly once stable. Aim 50\u2013125 mg/dL; correct abnormalities. IV glucose if feeding unsafe"],t.s)
B.adF=s(["Fluids / urine output: Record intake/output; review balance. Adjust fluids; baseline renal function / electrolytes. Repeat tests; blood gas / calcium as indicated"],t.s)
B.a7B=s(["Feeding: Assess alertness, suck\u2013swallow and tolerance. Breast milk when appropriate. Oral feeds when alert and safe"],t.s)
B.a4i=s(["Stable \u2022 Feeding safely \u2022 Family counselled \u2022 High-risk Neurodevelopmental follow-up including hearing assessment arranged"],t.s)
B.a4D=s(["Repeat and document neurological assessments","Maintain oxygenation, perfusion, temperature and glucose within target ranges","Counsel the family; ensure safe transfer and documented neurodevelopmental follow-up"],t.s)
B.a7j=s(["Do not assume an initially normal examination excludes evolving HIE","Do not give prophylactic anticonvulsants or unnecessary oxygen/fluid boluses","Do not delay TH referral in potentially eligible babies or start unmonitored cooling"],t.s)
B.a5Y=s(["Timely neurological assessment (%): At-risk neonates with a documented structured neurological assessment within 1 h* / All at-risk neonates \xd7100. Target >95%. *Within 1 h of birth (inborn) / admission (outborn)","Timely physiological assessment (%): Neonates with suspected HIE with complete physiological assessment** within 1 h of admission / All admitted neonates with suspected HIE \xd7100. Target >95%. **Temperature, glucose, oxygenation and perfusion documented"],t.s)
B.aeC=s(["Modified Sarnat assessment: Examination demonstration video","Therapeutic hypothermia: NNF India position statement (2021)"],t.s)
